# Non Goals (Out of Scope)

JANGAN implementasikan:
- realtime chat,
- forum,
- keuangan,
- absensi,
- AI chatbot,
- notification system,
- complex analytics,
- event booking,
- marketplace,
- role permission management.

Project harus tetap ringan dan fokus pada profile organization system.

---

# UI Principles

Setiap halaman harus:
- responsive,
- clean spacing,
- consistent typography,
- accessible,
- mudah dipahami warga umum.

Prioritaskan:
- visual hierarchy,
- readability,
- mobile usability.

---

# Coding Principles

Gunakan:
- reusable components,
- clean folder structure,
- modular architecture,
- readable naming convention.

Hindari:
- hardcoded data berlebihan,
- giant component,
- inline styling berlebihan,
- duplicated code.

---

